{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=June 2018}}
'''Group A of the 1986 FIFA World Cup''' was one of six groups of national teams competing at the [[1986 FIFA World Cup]]. The group's first round of matches began on 31 May and its last matches were played on 10 June.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/86full.html |title=World Cup 1986 |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref> Most matches were played at the [[Estadio Olímpico Universitario]] in [[Mexico City]] or at the [[Estadio Cuauhtémoc]] in [[Puebla]]. Eventual champions [[Argentina national football team|Argentina]] topped the group, joined in the second round by 1982 champions [[Italy national football team|Italy]] as well as [[Bulgaria national football team|Bulgaria]]. [[South Korea national football team|South Korea]] were making their first appearance in the tournament since 1954.

